    <bpmn:process id="W_W4017" name="W4017. Responsible Sourcing Governance, Cross-Functional Steering &amp; Decision Rights" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program operation; material decision; escalation
Frequency: Maintained + periodic
Volume: Enterprise responsible-sourcing governance
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Supply Chain
Participants: Sustainability, Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-122), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Legal (links to VS-100), HR (links to VS-19/VS-103), Compliance (links to VS-119), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Board (links to VS-36)
Source: workflow W4017 — Responsible Sourcing Governance, Cross-Functional Steering &amp; Decision Rights</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4017_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4017_Lane1" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4017_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4017_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4017_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4017_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4017_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4017_Start3" name="Program operation; material decision; escalation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4017_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4017_Task4" name="Sustainability/ESG Manager/VP Supply Chain operate the cross-functional…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sustainability/ESG Manager/VP Supply Chain operate the cross-functional responsible-sourcing steering: membership, cadence, decision rights (risk acceptance, sourcing consequences links to W4014, resource), escalation to CEO/Board, and integration with procurement, ESG (VS-25), ethics (VS-119), and audit (VS-21)
Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Supply Chain
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4017_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4017_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4017_Task5" name="Sustainability/ESG Manager maintain the roles, RACI, and the policy/framework…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sustainability/ESG Manager maintain the roles, RACI, and the policy/framework currency (links to W4001/W4003), and manage conflicts between commercial and human-rights priorities via documented decision rights
Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4017_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4017_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4017_Task6" name="Sustainability/ESG Manager report governance effectiveness and material…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability/ESG Manager report governance effectiveness and material decisions to the Board Audit/Risk Committee (links to VS-36/VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager / CEO
Accountable (A): Board Audit Committee
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4017_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4017_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4017_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4017_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4017_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-625 (ensure controlled execution — Responsible Sourcing Governance, Reporting &amp; Stakeholder Engagement (PA-131.3).) | - operational: documented rights and Board oversight; operational: clear decision rights
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Supply Chain</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4017_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4017_Annotation8" targetRef="W4017_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4017_Flow10" sourceRef="W4017_Start3" targetRef="W4017_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4017_Flow11" sourceRef="W4017_Task4" targetRef="W4017_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4017_Flow12" sourceRef="W4017_Task5" targetRef="W4017_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4017_Flow13" sourceRef="W4017_Task6" targetRef="W4017_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
