    <bpmn:process id="W_W4018" name="W4018. Supplier Development, Capacity Building &amp; Incentive Program" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: CAP findings (W4012); supplier-improvement need; strategic-vendor development
Frequency: Continuous + per program
Volume: High/enhanced-risk and strategic suppliers
Owner: VP Supply Chain / Sustainability/ESG Manager
Participants: Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-67/VS-122), Sustainability, Global Sourcing (links to VS-122), Merchandising (links to VS-01), external trainers, affected suppliers
Source: workflow W4018 — Supplier Development, Capacity Building &amp; Incentive Program</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4018_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4018_Lane1" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4018_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4018_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4018_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4018_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4018_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4018_Start3" name="CAP findings (W4012); supplier-improvement need; strategic-vendor development">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4018_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4018_Task4" name="Procurement/Sustainability design supplier development and capacity-building…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Procurement/Sustainability design supplier development and capacity-building programs: training (labor standards, safety, responsible recruitment, management systems), toolkits, peer learning, and on-site coaching — coordinated with vendor scorecard development (links to VS-67.3)
Responsible (R): Procurement / Sustainability
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per program</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4018_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4018_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4018_Task5" name="Procurement build incentives: preferred-supplier status, volume preference…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Procurement build incentives: preferred-supplier status, volume preference, longer terms, co-investment, and recognition for strong human-rights performance; disincentives for non-compliance (links to W4014)
Responsible (R): Procurement / Merchandising
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per program</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4018_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4018_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4018_Task6" name="Procurement/Sustainability measure program effectiveness (supplier improvement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Procurement/Sustainability measure program effectiveness (supplier improvement, audit-score trends, CAP closure rates), and iterate (links to W4019)
Responsible (R): Procurement / Sustainability / Analytics
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4018_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4018_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4018_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4018_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4018_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-625 (ensure controlled execution — Responsible Sourcing Governance, Reporting &amp; Stakeholder Engagement (PA-131.3).) | - operational: tailored programs; operational: meaningful commercial preference
Owner: VP Supply Chain / Sustainability/ESG Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4018_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4018_Annotation8" targetRef="W4018_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4018_Flow10" sourceRef="W4018_Start3" targetRef="W4018_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4018_Flow11" sourceRef="W4018_Task4" targetRef="W4018_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4018_Flow12" sourceRef="W4018_Task5" targetRef="W4018_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4018_Flow13" sourceRef="W4018_Task6" targetRef="W4018_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
