    <bpmn:process id="W_W4019" name="W4019. Human Rights KPI, Performance Management &amp; Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Reporting cadence; program review
Frequency: Quarterly + annual
Volume: Enterprise program
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager
Participants: Sustainability, Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-67), Analytics (links to VS-28), Compliance (links to VS-119), Internal Audit (links to VS-21), CEO, Board
Source: workflow W4019 — Human Rights KPI, Performance Management &amp; Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4019_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4019_Lane1" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4019_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4019_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4019_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4019_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4019_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4019_Start3" name="Reporting cadence; program review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4019_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4019_Task4" name="Sustainability/Analytics maintain human-rights KPIs: supplier risk-tier…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sustainability/Analytics maintain human-rights KPIs: supplier risk-tier distribution, audit coverage and findings, CAP closure rate/time, grievance volume/substantiation, remediation outcomes, traceability coverage, living-wage progress, and program maturity
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Analytics
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4019_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4019_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4019_Task5" name="Sustainability/Procurement review performance vs targets, identify…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sustainability/Procurement review performance vs targets, identify laggards/systemic issues, and drive improvement (links to W4018/W4012); integrate with vendor scorecard (links to VS-67)
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Procurement
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Supply Chain
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4019_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4019_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4019_Task6" name="Sustainability report to the Board Audit/Risk Committee (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability report to the Board Audit/Risk Committee (links to VS-36/VS-21.2) and into ESG reporting (links to VS-25.3/W4020)
Responsible (R): Sustainability / CEO
Accountable (A): Board Audit Committee
Duration: Quarterly + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4019_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4019_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4019_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4019_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4019_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-625 (ensure controlled execution — Responsible Sourcing Governance, Reporting &amp; Stakeholder Engagement (PA-131.3).) | - operational: outcome-oriented KPIs; operational: assurance and MDM (links to VS-29)
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4019_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4019_Annotation8" targetRef="W4019_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
