    <bpmn:process id="W_W4020" name="W4020. Modern Slavery / Human Rights Statutory &amp; Voluntary Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Reporting cycle; B2B customer request; regulatory requirement
Frequency: Annual + on request
Volume: Enterprise reporting
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Participants: Sustainability, Legal (links to VS-100), Compliance, Procurement (links to VS-03), HR (links to VS-19), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Corporate Communications (links to VS-14.3), external assurance
Source: workflow W4020 — Modern Slavery / Human Rights Statutory &amp; Voluntary Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4020_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4020_Lane1" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4020_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4020_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4020_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4020_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4020_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4020_Start3" name="Reporting cycle; B2B customer request; regulatory requirement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4020_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4020_Task4" name="Sustainability/Legal prepare statutory human-rights/modern-slavery disclosures…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sustainability/Legal prepare statutory human-rights/modern-slavery disclosures where applicable (modern-slavery statements for jurisdictions where BuildRight or its B2B customers operate — UK MSA, Australian MSA, German LkSG, EU CSDDD readiness) and respond to B2B-customer cascaded requests (questionnaires, CMRT/EMRT)
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Annual + on request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4020_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4020_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4020_Task5" name="Sustainability prepare voluntary disclosures integrated into ESG/sustainability…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sustainability prepare voluntary disclosures integrated into ESG/sustainability reporting (links to VS-25.3): UNGP progress, salient risks and actions, grievance/remediation data, KPIs, and goals — aligned to GRI/UNGC/SAI frameworks
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Comms
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4020_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4020_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4020_Task6" name="Sustainability/Legal obtain external assurance where required, manage…">
