    <bpmn:process id="W_W4024" name="W4024. Human Rights Program Maturity, Continuous Improvement &amp; Emerging Regulation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual program review; regulatory change; benchmark
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Enterprise program
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Participants: Sustainability, Legal (links to VS-100), Compliance, Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-122), Strategy (links to VS-33), Internal Audit (links to VS-21), CEO, Board
Source: workflow W4024 — Human Rights Program Maturity, Continuous Improvement &amp; Emerging Regulation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4024_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4024_Lane1" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4024_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4024_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4024_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4024_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4024_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4024_Start3" name="Annual program review; regulatory change; benchmark">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4024_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4024_Task4" name="Sustainability/ESG Manager/Legal monitor emerging human-rights regulation (EU…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sustainability/ESG Manager/Legal monitor emerging human-rights regulation (EU CSDDD, German LkSG, US UFLPA, UK/Australian MSA, PH developments) and B2B-customer/regulator expectations, and assess BuildRight&#x27;s exposure and readiness
Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager / Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4024_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4024_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4024_Task5" name="Sustainability/ESG Manager run the annual program maturity review (against…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sustainability/ESG Manager run the annual program maturity review (against UNGP/ISO frameworks and peers), identify gaps, benchmark, and prioritize improvements (process, data, scope, geographies)
Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager / Strategy
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4024_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4024_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4024_Task6" name="Sustainability/ESG Manager/CEO secure budget/resources from the Board (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability/ESG Manager/CEO secure budget/resources from the Board (links to VS-36), iterate the strategy (links to W4001/W4003), and report maturity and roadmap
Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager / CEO
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4024_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4024_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4024_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4024_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4024_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-625 (ensure controlled execution — Responsible Sourcing Governance, Reporting &amp; Stakeholder Engagement (PA-131.3).) | - operational: monitoring and readiness assessment; operational: benchmarking and annual review
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager / VP Legal &amp; Compliance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
